  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding the evaluation of nominations to the WH List (2026-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WH Fund sub-account for funding the evaluation of nominations by the Advisory Bodies was created in 2019 (Decision 43 COM 14). Since 2023, it is fully used to contribute to the financing of the nomination process, particularly the Preliminary Assessment requests to be processed by the World Heritage Centre, ICOMOS and IUCN, as from September 2023 (Decision 45 COM 15 adopted by the World Heritage Committee in 2023).</narrative>
  </description>
